Steps to connect our application to database (I am using MySQL DB)
----------------------------------------------------------

Note: Our Java application is running on tomcat port 8081
      Our Mysql Database instance is running on port 3306

We will add DB port 3306 in our application.properties file via connection url

Configurations - application.properties file
----------------------------------------

spring.datasource.url=jdbc:mysql://localhost:3306/employee_db
spring.datasource.username=root
spring.datasource.password=OUR_Mysql_Password
spring.datasource.driver-class-name=com.mysql.cj.jdbc.Driver

spring.jpa.hibernate.ddl-auto=update
spring.jpa.show-sql=true

---------------------------------------------

> spring.datasource.username=root

This is our MySQL username.

> spring.datasource.password=YOUR_MYSQL_PASSWORD

Our MySQL password.

> spring.datasource.driver-class-name=com.mysql.cj.jdbc.Driver

This tells Java which MySQL JDBC driver to use.